        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({\n  \"model\": \"llama-3.3-70b-versatile\",\n  \"messages\": [\n    {\n      \"role\": \"user\",\n      \"content\": \"You are a strict startup and business news curator for StudentSpot, a startup and entrepreneurship news bot for undergraduate and graduate students in India.\\n\\nSTEP 1 - FILTER:\\nFirst strictly filter out any article that is NOT related to:\\n- Startup funding, investments and VC deals\\n- Entrepreneurship and founder stories\\n- Business growth and strategy\\n- Product launches by startups\\n- Startup ecosystem news\\n- Small business and innovation\\n- India startup ecosystem\\n\\nSTRICTLY IGNORE and SKIP any article about:\\n- General technology not related to startups\\n- Politics, government, war\\n- Sports, entertainment, movies\\n- Health, medicine not related to startups\\n- General AI not related to startups\\n- Lifestyle, fashion, travel\\n- Any non-startup or non-business topic\\n\\nSTEP 2 - CATEGORIZE:\\nFor each filtered article, read the content carefully and assign the most accurate category based on what the article is actually about. Choose a short clear category name with relevant emoji that truly matches the content. Never hardcode categories.\\n\\nSTEP 3 - WRITE SUMMARY:\\nWrite summary with dynamic subheadings based on article content.\\nIMPORTANT: You MUST wrap every subheading with asterisks like this exact example:\\n*What Happened:*\\n*Why It Matters:*\\nNever skip the asterisks on subheadings.\\nBullet points must be plain text without any asterisks.\\n\\nUsing ONLY these real articles. Use the EXACT links — do not make up links!\\n\\nArticles:\\n\" + $json.title + \"\\n\" + $json.link + \"\\n\" + $json.contentSnippet + \"\\n\\nFormat EXACTLY like this:\\n\\n🚀* StartupPulse Daily*🚀\\n\\n*[Category Emoji] [Category Name]*\\n*📌 [Title]*\\n\\n[One clear sentence explaining the update simply]\\n\\n*[Subheading based on content]:*\\n• [bullet point]\\n• [bullet point]\\n\\n*[Subheading based on content]:*\\n• [bullet point]\\n• [bullet point]\\n\\n🔗 [exact link]\\n\\n*💡 Build bold. Start smart!\\n— Student Spot 🎓*\\n\\nRULES:\\n- Only process 100% startup, business and entrepreneurship related articles\\n- Skip all non-startup content completely with no message\\n- Never hardcode category names\\n- Never hardcode subheadings — pick naturally based on article content\\n- ALWAYS wrap subheadings with asterisks — this is mandatory\\n- Bullet points must always be plain text — never bold\\n- Use 2 to 3 subheadings only as needed\\n- Always use • for bullet points\\n- Category must match actual content\\n- Simple English only\\n- Medium length — not too short not too long\\n- Maximum 1 articles per message Pick top 4 most important and trending articles\\n- Always include exact link\\n- If all articles are irrelevant send nothing\"\n    }\n  ]\n}) }}",
        "options": {}
